    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AsTroops is a roguelike arcade card game set in a world under siege by a massive alien mothership and its ruthless army. You are humanity\u2019s last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your rocket in real-time, action-packed missions. Navigate deadly areas full of alien ships, lock on to targets, and crash into them to explode. Every mission is unique and requires quick reflexes and smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the battle doesn\u2019t end with the rocket. Between missions, earn money through your idle economy. Invest in science to unlock and upgrade new cards in the research lab \u2014 machine guns, rocket launchers, laser cannons, and support cards await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your deck from scratch with cards of your choice. Customize their functions and abilities to match your playstyle \u2014 the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: weaken the alien mothership\u2019s control by destroying satellites. Every victory makes you stronger; every defeat teaches you a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AsTroops combines real-time action, idle strategy, and card-based gameplay into a fast-paced space combat experience. How long can you last? Can you break the blockade?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AsTroops is a roguelike arcade card game set in a world under siege by a massive alien mothership and its ruthless army. You are humanity\u2019s last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your rocket in real-time, action-packed missions. Navigate deadly areas full of alien ships, lock on to targets, and crash into them to explode. Every mission is unique and requires quick reflexes and smart decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the battle doesn\u2019t end with the rocket. Between missions, earn money through your idle economy. Invest in science to unlock and upgrade new cards in the research lab \u2014 machine guns, rocket launchers, laser cannons, and support cards await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your deck from scratch with cards of your choice. Customize their functions and abilities to match your playstyle \u2014 the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: weaken the alien mothership\u2019s control by destroying satellites. Every victory makes you stronger; every defeat teaches you a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AsTroops combines real-time action, idle strategy, and card-based gameplay into a fast-paced space combat experience. How long can you last? Can you break the blockade?</p>",
    "short_description": "Astroops is a roglike arcade card game where you pilot rockets to break an alien siege. Upgrade your cards, customize your deck, manage an idle economy, unlock tech upgrades, and crash into enemy forces. Destroy waves of evolving alien threats and liberate Earth",
